    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86094" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πουλῠβότειρα</span></b> , ἡ,
		metri gr. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολυβότειρα,</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Hom.
		</span></i> and <i><span class="en">
			Hes.
		</span></i>; so all other compds. with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολύ</span>
		may be lengthd. in hexameter verse to <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πουλυ-,</span> metri gr., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολυ-</span>
			:—<i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> however uses the licence only in this word, in the gen. sg.
			of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πουλύπους,</span> and in the pr. n.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πουλυδάμας.</span></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
